                <head>544. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>According to telegram 18, July 14, Ambassador McIntosh extended to President Batlle an invitation from President Eisenhower to visit the United States. (Department of State,
                    Central Files, 733.11/7–1455) Batlle
                    visited the United States December 5–17. See <ref target="#d548">Documents
                        548</ref>, <ref target="#d549">549</ref>, and <ref target="#d550"
                    >550</ref>.</p>
            </div>
